# value — integer-valued properties

value treeness
value age

verb tap
    takes noun
    "Nothing to tap."

room Room "A room."

    object oak "A wizened oak."
        treeness = 10.
        age = 100.

        instead of examine:
            if treeness > 5:
                say "Very tree-like."
            else:
                say "Just a cute little shrub."

        instead of tap:
            oak treeness = 3.
            say "The oak shrinks."

test "default"
    examine oak. "Very tree-like"
    tap oak. "The oak shrinks"
    examine oak. "Just a cute little shrub"
